   951→  // FIX (Feb 15, 2026): Cap Whisper at 5s — ASR cascade can take 20s, eating into
   952→  // the analysis time budget and causing frontend timeout (35s). Browser transcription
   953→  // is good enough as fallback.
   954→  let whisperResult = null;
